    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Why?</i></strong><i>\u00a0is a minimalist first-person experience blending meditative repetition with visceral physicality. Punch your way through a brick-solid environment to uncover the truth behind its existence - or accept that some questions have no answers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With <strong>87.3% of play testers reporting</strong> either unexpected tranquillity or profound existential dread (Steam survey data pending), <strong>Why?</strong>\u00a0offers a uniquely polarized experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705<strong>Advanced Fist-to-Wall Physics:</strong> Our proprietary collision system ensures every punch <i>feels</i> impactful (disclaimer: knuckles safety not guaranteed)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705<strong>Dynamic Narrative Delivery:</strong> A disembodied voice provides <i>critical</i> motivational feedback at randomized intervals  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705<strong>Procedural Existentialism:</strong> Walls fracture in mathematically unsettling patterns fuelled by the OCD system (Ordered Chaos Destruction system is patent pending)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705<strong>Accessible Mastery Curve:</strong> Casual players enjoy 2.7 hours of median engagement; completionists report 14-hour ascension cycles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705<strong>Artisanal Achievements:</strong> 7 hand-illustrated Achievement badges to validate your life choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TECHNICAL HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic fist realism with industry-leading animations</strong> (velocity, angle, and regret variables)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Studio-quality existential commentary</strong>\u00a0recorded at 24-bit/96kHz in a professional sound booth (then heavily processed to sound appropriately disembodied)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lumen-powered impending doom\u00a0</strong>with ray-traced self-doubt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> full of meditative lo-fi droning (seriously)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY PLAY &quot;<i>WHY?</i>&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Therapeutic Value:</strong> 62% of users reported decreased productivity anxiety*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Philosophical Merit:</strong> Named &quot;Most Rhetorical Game of 2023&quot; <i>(self-proclaimed)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Benchmark Utility:</strong> Ideal for testing mouse durability (avg. 8,721 clicks/completion)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Test survey data from 1.5 respondents</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the debate</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Is it a commentary on creative futility? A parody of early-access culture? Or just a fist-shaped stress reliever? Share your theories in the Community Hub or our\u00a0<strong>Order + Chaos Discord</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
