h (then heavily processed to sound appropriately disembodied)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lumen-powered impending doom\u00a0</strong>with ray-traced self-doubt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> full of meditative lo-fi droning (seriously)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY PLAY &quot;<i>WHY?</i>&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Therapeutic Value:</strong> 62% of users reported decreased productivity anxiety*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Philosophical Merit:</strong> Named &quot;Most Rhetorical Game of 2023&quot; <i>(self-proclaimed)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Benchmark Utility:</strong> Ideal for testing mouse durability (avg. 8,721 clicks/completion)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Test survey data from 1.5 respondents</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the debate</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Is it a commentary on creative futility? A parody of early-access culture? Or just a fist-shaped stress reliever? Share your theories in the Community Hub or our\u00a0<strong>Order + Chaos Discord</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
